<title>JAPAN: Murata - 6mth group results.</title>
<headline>Murata - 6mth group results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Group)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		162.24		vs	  164.15</p>
<p> Operating	   30.43		vs	   37.45</p>
<p> Current	     32.71		vs	   39.52</p>
<p> Net		   16.18		vs	   19.95</p>
<p> EPS		   66.46 yen	  vs	   81.92 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Murata Manufacturing Co Ltd is a major manufacturer of ceramic capacitors. (Figures are reported based on U.S. accounting rules.)</p>
</text>
